Splits a trait key into type and category components.

## Parameters

* `trait_key` - The trait key in the format "type/category"

## Returns

* A tuple of {type, category}

## Examples

    iex> Mix.Tasks.Prismatic.Traits.Dependencies.split_trait_key("cognitive/analytical")
    {"cognitive", "analytical"}

    iex> Mix.Tasks.Prismatic.Traits.Dependencies.split_trait_key("emotional/happy")
    {"emotional", "happy"}

